Description:

JMAP PushSubscription (RFC 8620 section 7.2).  Cyrus stores subscriptions and
implements PushSubscription/get and /set; a separate notification service
sends the pushes, using the PushSubscriptionCreated event and the
`/dblookup/pushsubs` endpoint.


Documentation:

docsrc/rfc-support.rst


Config changes:

New `jmap_push_types` option, listing the JMAP data types a PushSubscription
may ask for.


Upgrade instructions:

The modseq counters file moves to format version 10, and the DAV database to
schema version 20, both of which are upgraded automatically.  Older versions
of Cyrus can't read the new counters format, so downgrading after the upgrade
isn't supported.


